      "writtenOn": "2023-02-09T19:50:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can we have a common base class for all of these events and expose a single API to get the report that corresponds to the report id? This design does not scale and requires new APIs for each report type.\n\nSomething along the lines of:\n\nBqrCommon implements Parcelable\nBqrVsCommon extends BqrCommon\nBqrVsA2dpChoppy extends BqrVsCommon\nBqrVsScoChoppy extends BqrVsCommon\nBqrConnectFail extends BqrVsCommon\n\nAfter this, you can store a single BqrCommon object and have an API that returns it. You can check what type it is by doing an instanceof check / checking the report id type.",
      "revId": "5c1b807a38a57640d12034b01b44e9d27f37ac36",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
